1
00:04:13,636 --> 00:04:19,636
A furry tale about me.

2
00:08:27,272 --> 00:08:33,272
The Amazing Maurice is a animation, adventure,
comedy film directed by Toby Genkel.

3
00:12:40,909 --> 00:12:46,909
Maurice is a streetwise ginger cat who comes up with a money-making
scam by befriending a group of self-taught talking rats.

4
00:16:54,545 --> 00:17:00,545
When Maurice and the rodents meet a bookworm called Malicia,
their little con soon goes down the drain.

5
00:21:08,181 --> 00:21:14,181
Maurice (voice), played by Hugh Laurie.

6
00:25:21,818 --> 00:25:27,818
Malicia (voice), played by Emilia Clarke.

7
00:29:35,454 --> 00:29:41,454
Boss Man / Rat King (voice), played by David Thewlis.

8
00:33:49,090 --> 00:33:55,090
Keith (voice), played by Himesh Patel.

9
00:38:02,727 --> 00:38:08,727
Dangerous Beans (voice), played by David Tennant.

10
00:42:16,363 --> 00:42:22,363
Peaches (voice), played by Gemma Arterton.

11
00:46:30,000 --> 00:46:36,000
The Amazing Maurice is a 2022 animated fantasy comedy film directed by Toby Genkel and co-directed by Florian Westermann, from a
screenplay by Terry Rossio, based on the 2001 novel The Amazing Maurice and His Educated Rodents by Terry Pratchett.

12
00:50:43,636 --> 00:50:49,636
The film stars Hugh Laurie, Emilia Clarke, David Thewlis, Himesh Patel, Gemma Arterton, Joe
Sugg, Ariyon Bakare, Julie Atherton, Rob Brydon, Hugh Bonneville and David Tennant.

13
00:54:57,272 --> 00:55:03,272
The story follows Maurice, a streetwise ginger cat who befriends the
talking rats by coming up with a money-making scam.

14
00:59:10,909 --> 00:59:16,909
An animated film adaptation of Pratchett's novel was announced in
June 2019, with Rossio writing the screenplay.

15
01:03:24,545 --> 01:03:30,545
Most of the lead cast members were hired in November 2020,
with additional cast being added in May 2021.

16
01:07:38,181 --> 01:07:44,181
Animation was provided by Studio Rakete and Red Star 3D.

17
01:11:51,818 --> 01:11:57,818
The Amazing Maurice had its premiere at the Manchester Animation Festival on 13 November
2022, and was released in the United Kingdom on 16 December, by Sky Cinema.

18
01:16:05,454 --> 01:16:11,454
It was released on 3 February 2023 by Viva Pictures in the United States.

19
01:20:19,090 --> 01:20:25,090
The film received generally positive reviews from critics.

20
01:24:32,727 --> 01:24:38,727
The film explores themes of based on novel or book, grim
reaper, cartoon cat, nine lives, rat.

21
01:28:46,363 --> 01:28:52,363
The tone is lighthearted.
